{"anchorId":3058,"message":"In London, I expected history to live in buildings, but here I found it breathing quietly through bark and branches. Standing beneath this old plane, I felt that the city was not only something to see, but something patient enough to be witnessed with.","witnessAddress":"0x9602b5803f77aa35444d80b4ca9d1cdde7c91c83","timestamp":"2026-03-24T10:33:09.930Z","secretVerified":true}